+# ClearanceJobs → Contact Pipeline — Implementation Plan
+
+> **For agentic workers:** Spec = `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-02-clearancejobs-contact-pipeline-design.md`.
+> Execution mode: **autonomous to completion** (user away ~45 min, authorized full build).
+> Orchestrator builds foundation + spine; two background subagents build the lanes. Atomic commits throughout.
+
+**Goal:** Turn the downloaded ClearanceJobs pastes + resumes into canonical Contact JSON, match them to the Booz programs, emit per-program HUMINT call sheets — fully local, PII gitignored.
+
+**Architecture:** Two ingest lanes (deterministic paste parser; liteparse+deterministic+Ollama resume parser) → shared `models.RawContact` → Stage A map → Stage B dedup → Stage C program match → Stage D call sheets. `lib/` reuses the primitives already in `build_contacts.py`.
+
+**Tech Stack:** Python 3.12, stdlib + pdfplumber/fitz/python-docx/mammoth (local parse), liteparse 2.0.0, Ollama `llama3.1:8b` (local HTTP `:11434`), pytest. No cloud.
+
+**Environment (probed 2026-06-02):** all parse libs present; Ollama running (`llama3.1:8b`, `qwen3.5`); `contacts_classified.json` = 9.5 MB / 7,339 contacts; `.gitignore` needs `intake/`+`humint/`.
+
+---
+
+## File Structure
+
+```
+clearancejobs_pipeline/
+  __init__.py
+  models.py              # RawContact dataclass + canonical Contact builder (THE CONTRACT)
+  intake.py              # Stage 0: allow-list copy Downloads -> intake/ (only Downloads-touching module)
+  intake_allowlist.json  # explicit named files + lane
+  lib/
+    __init__.py
+    classify.py          # tier_for() — 6-tier title regex (from build_contacts.py)
+    geo.py               # ABBR2FULL, city_key(), config_city_keys()
+    companies.py         # COMPANY_PATS + canonical_company()
+    cj_id.py             # filename -> (cj_id|None, name_slug)
+  lanes/
+    __init__.py
+    paste.py             # Lane 1 — deterministic block-split + regex classify   [AGENT A]
+    resume.py            # Lane 2 — liteparse/local parse + deterministic + Ollama [AGENT B]
+  spine/
+    __init__.py
+    map_contact.py       # Stage A — RawContact -> canonical Contact (50 props)
+    resolve.py           # Stage B — dedup (cj_id -> name+loc) incl. vs 7,339
+    match_programs.py     # Stage C — score contact vs _contract_config.json programs
+    call_sheet.py        # Stage D — per-PIID MD + CSV + HUMINT_SUMMARY
+  run.py                 # orchestrate Stage 0->D; flags: --no-ollama (default), --ollama
+  tests/                 # pytest, fixtures only (NO real PII committed)
+    test_cj_id.py test_geo.py test_classify.py test_paste.py
+    test_resume.py test_map.py test_resolve.py test_match.py
+
+intake/clearancejobs/{pastes,resumes,contacts}/   # GITIGNORED (PII)
+outputs/booz_target_ranking/humint/               # GITIGNORED (PII call sheets)
+```
+
+## Data contract (models.py — every module imports this)
+
+- `RawContact` dataclass: `lane`, `source_file`, `cj_id`, `name`, `first_name`, `last_name`,
+  `title`, `company`, `city`, `state`, `clearance_level`, `clearances[]`, `email`, `phone`,
+  `linkedin_url`, `relo`(bool|None), `salary_expectation`, `seniority_band`, `cj_last_login`,
+  `cj_last_login_hot`(bool), `keyword_thumbnail`, `prior_companies[]`, `skills[]`,
+  `confidence`("A"/"B"/"C"), `extra`(dict). Lanes return `List[RawContact]`.
+- `build_contact(raw) -> dict`: maps RawContact -> the 50-prop Contact schema (see spec §6.4),
+  filling `programs/primes/scores` later (Stage C). Local key = `cj_id or f"{slug(name)}|{city_key}"`.
+
